## Rollback Information

**Backup Location**: `/opt/immich-app.backup-<timestamp>` (inside LXC 101)

**Rollback Command**:
```bash
pct exec 101 -- bash -c "cd /opt/immich-app && docker compose down"
pct exec 101 -- bash -c "rm -rf /opt/immich-app && mv /opt/immich-app.backup-<timestamp> /opt/immich-app"
pct exec 101 -- bash -c "cd /opt/immich-app && docker compose up -d"
```

**After Rollback**:
- Revert Ansible variables to v1.121.0
- Re-run playbook to ensure consistency
- Verify v1 is functioning

